{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scarecrow\u2019s Curse</strong> is a tension-filled horror game set in a dark, abandoned village. Haunted scarecrows lurk in the shadows, watching your every move. To survive, you must solve puzzles, escape their grasp, and uncover the mystery behind the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creeping through silent fields, eerie forests, and forsaken buildings, only one thought stays with you: <strong>never let the scarecrow see you.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple-to-learn controls but ever-growing tension, the game blends exploration and survival horror into an immersive experience. Every choice will bring you one step closer to freedom\u2026 or to the curse itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe2 <strong>Atmosphere of Fear and Suspense</strong><br>Tense environments filled with dread across fields and haunted locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udfe1 <strong>Survival Mechanics</strong><br>Hide, run, and make smart choices to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd34 <strong>Intelligent Enemy AI</strong><br>Cursed scarecrows adapt to your actions and never give up the hunt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd35 <strong>Puzzles and Exploration</strong><br>Discover hidden paths, lost documents, and unravel the secrets of the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? In the world of whispering fields, ominous shadows, and cursed scarecrows, there\u2019s only one goal: <strong>survive.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3946420?t=1759775687","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946420/6fc8572794176926ad046b8aae8ce10e1bf44258/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759775687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3946420/94cff911981fae00046d035bea2b5e68